#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Upoznavanje"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "What's &amor;?"
msgstr "Šta je &amor;?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&amor; is an acronym which stands for Amusing Misuse of Resources. It is "
"actually an animation which sits on top of your active window. In its "
"default configuration, &amor; takes the form of a yellow spot which performs "
"many tricks. &amor; also has many different themes which change the "
"appearance and behavior of the animation."
msgstr ""
"&amor; je akronim koji znači Aktivno Maltretiranje Ograničenih Resursa. To "
"je u stvari animacija koja stoji na vrhu vašeg aktivnog prozora. U svojoj "
"osnovnoj konfiguraciji, &amor; uzima oblik žute tačke koja izvodi razne "
"trikove. &amor; takođe ima razne teme koje mijenjaju izgled i ponašanje "
"animacije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Since &amor; works with the &kde; window manager &kwin;, the application "
"will only work from within &kde;. It is possible that &amor; would work from "
"within another &kde;-compliant window manager, but none are known to work at "
"the time of this writing."
msgstr ""
"Pošto &amor; radi sa &kde; windowa menađerom &kwin;, aplikacija će jedino "
"raditi sa &kde;. Moguće je da &amor; bi radio sa drugim &kde;-komplementarni "
"windows menađer, ali nijedan nije poznat da radi u vrijeme kad se ovo pisalo."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring &amor;"
msgstr "Konfiguracija &amor;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To configure &amor;, click on the animation using your &RMB;. A menu will "
"appear containing three items: <guimenuitem>Configure...</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Help...</guimenuitem>, and <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>. "
"Choose <guimenuitem>Configure...</guimenuitem> to configure &amor;"
msgstr ""
"Da biste konfigurisali &amor;, kliknite na animaciju koristeći svoj &RMB;. "
"Izborik će se pojaviti sadržeći tri stavke <guimenuitem>Konfiguriši...</"
"guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem> Pomoć...</guimenuitem>, i <guimenuitem>Prekid </"
"guimenuitem>. Izaberite <guimenuitem>Konfiguriši...</guimenuitem> da biste "
"konfigurisali  &amor;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "General Options"
msgstr "Generalne Opcije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The following settings for &amor; can be changed from the Options dialog:"
msgstr ""
"Slijedeće postavke za  &amor; mogu se promijeniti kroz Opcijski dijalog:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Theme</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Teme</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This determines the appearance and behavior of &amor;. Themes are described "
"in the next section."
msgstr ""
"Ovo određuje prikaz i ponašanje od  &amor;. Teme su opisane u slijedećoj "
"sekciji."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "Offset"
msgstr "Offset"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This slider controls where the animation appears in relation to the top of "
"the active window. The default middle setting will place the animation right "
"above the window title bar, whereas setting the slider all the way to the "
"top or bottom will result in the animation appearing a fair distance above "
"or below the title bar, respectively."
msgstr ""
"Klizač kontroliše gdje će se pojaviti animacije povezane sa vrhom aktivnog "
"prozora. Default postavki će postaviti animaciju tačno iznad imena prozora, "
"postavke klizača će postavljati od vrha do dna razultate animacija ."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Setting this slider to a lower setting will allow the animation to be "
"visible even when the active window is maximized."
msgstr ""
"Postavke ovog klizača za niže niže postavke dozvoljava animaciji da bude "
"vidljiva kada je aktivni prozor maximiziran."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid "Always on top"
msgstr "Uvijek na vrhu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Checking this option will cause the animation to always appear in front of "
"any existing windows on the screen, including the panel."
msgstr ""
"Provjera ove opcije će uzrokovato uvijek pojavu animacije ispred bilo kojeg "
"postojećeg prozora na ekranu, uključujuči ploču."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show random tips"
msgstr "Prikaži redom savjete"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If checked, the animation will display various &kde;-related tips at random "
"intervals."
msgstr ""
"Ako je provjereno, animacija će se pojaviti u više načina &kde;-povezani "
"savjeti sa redom intervala."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use random character"
msgstr "Koristi redom znakove"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If checked, the theme selection is disabled, it will be changed randomly."
msgstr "Ako je označeno, selekcija teme je isključena, mijenjati će se redom."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allow application tips"
msgstr "Dozvoli savjete za aplikacije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Any &kde; application can be designed to display helpful tips via &amor;. If "
"this option is checked, and an appropriate application is the active window, "
"the animation will display tips for that application."
msgstr ""
"Bilo koja &kde; može biti dizajnirana da bi prikazalo pomoćne savjete &amor;."
"Ako je ova opcija provjerena, i prikladna aplikacija je aktivan prozor, "
"animacija će prikazati savjete za aplikaciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the time of this writing, no &kde; applications make use of this "
"functionality."
msgstr ""
"U vrijeme kad se ovo pisalo, &kde; aplikacije koriste ovu funkcionalnost."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid "&amor; Themes"
msgstr "&amor; Teme"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&amor; comes with many built-in themes, which change the appearance and "
"behavior of the animation. In addition, it is possible to create new &amor; "
"themes. The built-in themes for &amor; are described in the table below"
msgstr ""
"&amor; dolazi sa već posatavljenim temama, koje mijenjaju prikaz i ponašanje "
"animacija. Kao dodatak, moguće je kreirati novu &amor; temu. Izgrađivanje "
"tema za &amor; je opisano u tabeli ispod"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "Available &amor; Themes"
msgstr "Dostupne &amor; Teme"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid "<entry>Theme</entry>"
msgstr "<entry>Teme</entry>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Naziv"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid "Multi-Talented Spot"
msgstr "Multi-Talentirani Spot"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the default theme for &amor;, and also the one with the most "
"<quote>tricks</quote>. This theme was created by &Martin.R.Jones;. The jet-"
"pack, beaming, and fire animations were contributed by "
"<personname><firstname>Mark</firstname><surname>Grant</surname></personname>."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je defoult tema za &amor;, i također jedina s najviše <quote>trikova</"
"quote>. Ova tema je kreirana od &Martin.R.Jones;.  Jet-paket, ozaren, i "
"vatrene animacije su doprinjele  <personname><firstname>Mark</"
"firstname><surname>Grant</surname></personname>."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:159
#, no-c-format
msgid "Spooky Ghost"
msgstr "Spooky Ghost"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A ghost theme based-on the &kde; <application>ghostview</application> icon. "
"Spooky Ghost was created by &Martin.R.Jones;."
msgstr ""
"Tema duhova je bazirana na  &kde;<application>izgled duh</application>ikona. "
"Sablasni Duh je kreiran od strane &Martin.R.Jones;."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid "Crazy Eyes"
msgstr "Lude Oči"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This theme consists of a moving pair of eyes, and was created by "
"<personname><firstname>Jean-Claude</firstname><surname>Dumas</surname></"
"personname>."
msgstr ""
"Ovu temu sačinjava par očiju koje se pomijeraju, i kreirana je od strane "
"<personname><firstname>Jean-Claude</firstname><surname>Dumas</surname></"
"personname>."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bonhomme"
msgstr "Bonhomme"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:183
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A stick-figure animation, created by <personname><firstname>Jean-Claude</"
"firstname><surname>Dumas</surname></personname>."
msgstr ""
"Stick-figure animacije, kreirane od strane <personname><firstname>Jean-"
"Claude</firstname><surname>Dumas</surname></personname>."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid "Neko"
msgstr "Neko"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Neko is a cat theme by <personname><firstname>Chris</"
"firstname><surname>Spiegel</surname></personname>. The graphics are "
"originally from <application>Oneko</application>, which was written by "
"<personname><firstname>Masayuki</firstname><surname>Koba</surname></"
"personname>."
msgstr ""
"Neko je tema mačke od <personname><firstname>Chris</"
"firstname><surname>Spiegel</surname></personname>. Grafika je originalno od "
"m <application>Oneko</application>, which was written by "
"<personname><firstname>Masayuki</firstname><surname>Koba</surname></"
"personname>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<application>Oneko</application> is a small application which features a cat "
"chasing the mouse cursor. The application appears to no longer be "
"maintained, but the <ulink url=\"ftp://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/X11/demos/"
"oneko-1.1b.tar.gz\"> source code</ulink> from the last version is still "
"available."
msgstr ""
"<application>Oneko</application>je mala aplikacija koja prikazuje mačku koja "
"juri kursor miša. Ova aplikacija nije više podržana, ali <ulink url=\"ftp://"
"sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/X11/demos/oneko-1.1b.tar.gz\"> source code</ulink> "
"je sa stare aplikacije još uvijek dostupna."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:210
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Tux</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Tux</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This theme features Tux, the &Linux; mascot. The actual graphics come from a "
"<application>Lemmings</application>-style game called <ulink url=\"http://"
"pingus.seul.org/\"> <application>Pingus</application></ulink>. The Tux theme "
"was created by <personname><firstname>Frank</firstname><surname>Pieczynski</"
"surname></personname>."
msgstr ""
"Ova tema posjeduje  Tux, the &Linux; maskotu. Trenutna grafika dolazi od "
"<application>Lemmings</application>-style game called <ulink url=\"http://"
"pingus.seul.org/\"> <application>Pingus</application></ulink>. Tux tema je "
"kreirana od strane  <personname><firstname>Frank</"
"firstname><surname>Pieczynski</surname></personname>."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid "Little Worm"
msgstr "Mali Crv"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:225
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A small inchworm theme. Created by <personname><firstname>Bartosz</"
"firstname><surname>Trudnowski</surname></personname> for his wife."
msgstr ""
"Mala crvasta tema. Kreirana od strane <personname><firstname>Bartosz</"
"firstname><surname>Trudnowski</surname></personname> za njegovu suprugu."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid "Little Billy"
msgstr "Mali Billy"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A static image taken from the game <ulink url=\"http://www.xbill.org/"
"\"><application>XBill</application> </ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Statička slika preuzeta iz igre <ulink url=\"http://www.xbill.org/"
"\"><application>XBill</application> </ulink>."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid "FreeBSD Mascot"
msgstr "FreeBSD Maskota"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid "A static image of Beastie, the FreeBSD daemon."
msgstr "Statična slika Beastie, the FreeBSD daemon."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid "Unanimated Tux"
msgstr "Neanimirani Tux"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid "An unanimated version of the Tux theme."
msgstr "Jedna ne animirana verzija Tux teme."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:267
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Tao</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Tao</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:268
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Tao theme is an animated Yin Yang symbol. This theme was created by "
"<personname><firstname>Daniel</firstname><surname>Pfeiffer</surname></"
"personname> <email>occitan@esperanto.org</email>, and was inspired by his "
"Tai Chi practice."
msgstr ""
"The Tao tema je animirani Yin Yang simbol. Ova tema je kreirana od strane "
"<personname><firstname>Daniel</firstname><surname>Pfeiffer</surname></"
"personname> <email>occitan@esperanto.org</email>, i inspirisana je njegovom "
"Tai Chi vježbom."

